        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.12.1+EXO.12.2+EXO.12.3+EXO.12.4+EXO.12.5+EXO.12.6+EXO.12.7+EXO.12.8+EXO.12.9+EXO.12.10+EXO.12.11+EXO.12.12+EXO.12.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kutsama 12:1–13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aiziraeli ariphokala akachita kambi Giligali, asherekeya sikukuu ya Pasaka dziloni ya siku ya kumi na ne ya mwezi hiko tsi za kugbwa za seemu za Jeriko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na siku ya phiriye bada ya Pasaka, siku iyo-iyo achirya mavuno ga iyo tsi: mikahe isiyotiywa hamira na ndodore. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.16.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kutsama 16:35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku ya phiri bada ya kurya mavuno ga yo tsi, chakurya cha manna chasika, ela Aiziraeli achikala anarya mavuno ga tsi ya Kanani mwaka uho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.5.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku mwenga Joshuwa ariphokala phephi na mudzi wa Jeriko, gafula waona mutu akaima mbereze kuno akagbwira upanga uchiotsomolwa chowani naye Joshuwa achimsengerera achimuuza, “Dze! We u uphande wehu hebu wa maadui gehu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye achijibu achiamba, “Si wa uphande wenu wala wa maadui genu. Ela mimi ni mkpwulu wa jeshi ra Mwenyezi Mlungu na vivi nikatsoloka.” Phahi Joshuwa wadzibwaga chimabumabu achiabudu, chisha achimuuza, “Bwana unalonda nihendeni mino mtumishio?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuya chilongozi wa jeshi ra Mwenyezi Mlungu wamuamba Joshuwa, “Vula virahuvyo, mana phatu uimirepho ni phatakatifu.” Naye Joshuwa achihenda hivyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.5.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
